<title>UK: United News down on overhang of stock.</title>
<headline>United News down on overhang of stock.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in United News &amp; Media Plc fell on Tuesday and traders said an overhang of stock had prevented the company sharing the FTSE's positive tone.</p>
<p>By 1210 GMT United News shares were 6-1/2p weaker at 667.</p>
<p>&quot;There's not much behind it except for an overhang of stock in the market over the last couple of days,&quot; one market-maker said.</p>
<p>&quot;There seems to be a lot of stock about,&quot; another said.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
